Turning off Power System
In case of an emergency, the power system can be turned off as follows when normal pullover is allowed:
1) After the vehicle is stopped, press the EPB switch (same as P gear), the red indicator lamp on the driver
   screen     is always on and the electronic parking brake is enabled.




2) Tap "Settings - General - Vehicle Power Supply - Power Off"




